              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Skirmishers have hand weapon, sling and buckler. Skirmishers. May replace sling with javelins (free) or composite bow (+1). May upgrade buckler to shield (+1). Kurds may have throwing spear (+3) and light armour (+2).</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
