              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">The mahout and 2 crew are armed with hand weapons and javelins. There may be a third crewman (+10). The crew may have light armour (+2) and composite bow (+2) or pike (+3). May have a shield (+1) if not armed with pike. The crew may fight from a howdah (+6).</characteristic>
